WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
It’s time to seal the magic seal. You can do whatever you want. We are willing.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,700
Yes, yes, 100 of us are willing

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,700
You are responsible for high-intensity external reception and brand display

4
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,500
There are fixed expenses for clothing, makeup and margins.

5
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,600
Therefore, the company added an image position allowance

6
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,800
Course is paid monthly according to job standards

7
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,800
If you have a boyfriend or get married

8
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:14,800
The subsidy is gone

9
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,900
Because that is the obligation of the boyfriend or husband

10
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,900
Disburse image allowance according to position

11
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,700
You can also evaluate and reimburse votes

12
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:25,850
OMG

13
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:27,450
Annual salary of one million, room and car allocation

14
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:30,050
Now I give you 100,000 yuan a month to buy cosmetics. My dad is not that old.

15
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:31,950
Boss, I love you and I will always be your full-time secretary.

16
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:35,150
I will always be as bold as a flower for you, boss, and I will always love you. I will always be Tianbao’s auctioneer. Okay, okay.

17
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:36,850
Do you have any other reasonable suggestions you can make?

18
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:37,850
The company can do better

19
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:41,650
Let the staff, especially you, live a happier life by building a canteen. It’s very troublesome to eat now.

20
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:43,550
I don’t want to cook it myself and I don’t want to eat takeout every day.

21
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:44,550
Open a high-end beauty salon

22
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:46,250
Then we can do all kinds of skin care every day

23
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:47,750
Can I take the liberty of spending more time in the cafeteria?
